## 9. Expected Outcomes

- Faster and more consistent candidate screening.
- Transparent decisions that recruiters can verify.
- Useful feedback for candidates on skill gaps.
- A foundation for fair, explainable AI in recruitment.

## 10. Future Scope

- Support for multiple languages.
- Integration with applicant tracking systems.
- Fairness audits and bias metrics dashboards.
- Personalized learning recommendations for missing skills.

